<style>
:root{--bg:#07080f;--panel:#0d1020;--line:#20253d;--fg:#ece5d3;--muted:#9b97ab;--gold:#f2c14e;color-scheme:dark}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg);font-family:"Hind",system-ui,sans-serif}
main{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:40px max(16px,env(safe-area-inset-left,0px));display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px}
h1{font-family:"Marcellus",Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(26px,5vw,38px);margin:0}
h1 span{font-family:"Tiro Devanagari Sanskrit",serif;color:var(--gold);margin-right:10px}
p{color:var(--muted);margin:0}
a.card{display:block;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;color:var(--fg);text-decoration:none}
a.card:hover{border-color:var(--gold)}a.card b{font-family:"Marcellus",Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:20px;display:block}
a.card small{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}.old{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}.old a{color:var(--gold);font-size:14px}
</style></head><body><main>
<h1><span>र्ष्क्ष्रीं</span>Shreem Visualizations</h1>
<p>Guided visualizations of the Shreem Beej Mantra, its five meridian networks and bilateral writing.</p>
<a class="card" href="part1.html"><b>Part 1 · Meridian flow</b><small>Eleven scenes: the five elemental meridians through a transparent body, with organs, nerves, vessels, lymph and the brain.</small></a>
<a class="card" href="part2.html"><b>Part 2 · Neural integration</b><small>Twelve shots of bilateral Shreem writing, from baseline brain state to integration.</small></a>
<a class="card" href="part3/index.html"><b>Part 3 · 3D anatomy (prototype)</b><small>A real 3D transparent body with organs, brain, nerves, vessels and lymph, and a guided tour for each meridian.</small></a>
